import streamlit as st

st.title("Executive Summary")
st.write("When pool cues are not being maintained, they flatten down over time, and the flatter tips struggle to pick up chalk. " \
"It is important for cues to be fully and evenly chalked, because chalk increases the friction between the ball and cue, allowing the player to play a larger variety of shots.")
st.write("The scope of the project is to create a product that helps cue tips that are flat or round pick up chalk evenly.")
st.write("We began looking at the problem space by observing players at public pool halls and asking them about their experiences with chalking cues. " \
"With that information, we created prototypes for different designs that we wanted to test out. " \
"We tested our product with students and observed how they approached our product with no prior knowledge of it.")
st.write("Our product is a handheld cue tip chalker. It is composed of a handle, a shroud, and the chalk itself. More specifically, our product is a semi-spherical piece of chalk surrounded by a shroud on an applicator. To evenly apply chalk on all different pool cue tips shapes, the user utilizes circular motions around the chalk to reach all areas of the cue tip. The shroud surrounding the chalk is a guide to help build intuition on how the product is used, in circular motions around the semi-sphere. These two components sit on a handle for the user to grip onto. ")
st.image("chalk_pop.png", "Figure 1: The Chalk Pop")